✈️ New Final Trip Weekly Deck
This replaces the previous weekly deck. Because the trip is Wednesday, the goal is to drill these aggressively through departure.

10 Core
¿Quieres que ponga música o prefieres que hablemos?
Do you want me to put on music, or would you rather we talk?
¿Quieres que nos tomemos una foto juntos?
Do you want us to take a picture together?
¿Quieres quedarte aquí un rato o quieres salir?
Do you want to stay here for a while or do you want to go out?
¿Tienes frío o está bien la temperatura?
Are you cold, or is the temperature okay?
¿Qué ha sido lo que más te ha gustado del viaje hasta ahora?
What have you liked most about the trip so far?
Siento que podemos hablar de cualquier cosa.
I feel like we can talk about anything.
Ojalá esta sea la primera de muchas aventuras juntos.
I hope this is the first of many adventures together.
Quiero aprovechar cada momento contigo.
I want to make the most of every moment with you.
Me gusta mucho cómo me siento cuando estoy contigo.
I really like how I feel when I’m with you.
Me gustas muchísimo y me encanta estar contigo. No quiero apresurar nada, pero si tú sientes lo mismo, ¿te gustaría ser mi novia?
I really like you and I love being with you. I don’t want to rush anything, but if you feel the same way, would you like to be my girlfriend?
That last one is deliberately long. We’ll learn it by chunks, not expect instant full recall today.

